-<li>Community management best practices: Handling comments, direct messages, and customer feedback.</li>
-</ul>
-
-<h3>3. Advertising on Facebook and Instagram</h3>
-<ul>
-<li>Navigating Meta Ads Manager like a professional.</li>
-<li>Audience targeting techniques: Core audiences, custom audiences, and lookalike audiences.</li>
-<li>Setting up ad budgets, bidding strategies, and campaign schedules.</li>
-</ul>
