-<h3>4. Measuring and Analyzing Performance</h3>
-<ul>
-<li>Installing and configuring the Meta Pixel and Conversions API.</li>
-<li>Reading analytics dashboards to interpret click-through rates (CTR), cost per click (CPC), and conversions.</li>
-<li>A/B testing ad creatives and copy to maximize campaign efficiency.</li>
-</ul>
